Get all offices,Get every office from the database,offices,All columns,None,None
Show all product lines,Get every product line from the database,productlines,All columns,None,None
List all payments,Get every payment from the database,payments,All columns,None,None
Get product names and prices,Get the name and pricing of each product,products,"productName, buyPrice, MSRP",None,None
Get customer names and cities,Get the name and city of each customer,customers,"customerName, city",None,None
List employee first and last names,Get the full name of each employee,employees,"firstName, lastName",None,None
Get all order dates,Get the date each order was placed,orders,orderDate,None,None
Show product vendor list,Get a unique list of all product suppliers,products,productVendor (distinct),None,None
Get all product codes,Get the unique code for every product,products,productCode,None,None
List all countries from offices,Get a unique list of countries where offices exist,offices,country (distinct),None,None
Show all order statuses,Get a unique list of all possible order statuses,orders,status (distinct),None,None
Get all payment amounts,Get the amount paid for each payment,payments,amount,None,None
List all job titles,Get a unique list of all job roles in the company,employees,jobTitle (distinct),None,None
Get customer phone numbers,Get the name and phone number of each customer,customers,"customerName, phone",None,None
Show product MSRP values,Get the name and retail price of each product,products,"productName, MSRP",None,None
List order numbers,Get the unique identifier for every order,orders,orderNumber,None,None
Get orders with customer names,For each order show which customer placed it,"orders, customers","orderNumber, orderDate, status, customerName",None,orders JOIN customers ON customerNumber
Get employees with office city,For each employee show which city they work in,"employees, offices","employeeNumber, firstName, lastName, city",None,employees JOIN offices ON officeCode
Get payments with customer names,For each payment show which customer made it,"payments, customers","customerNumber, customerName, checkNumber, paymentDate, amount",None,payments JOIN customers ON customerNumber
Get order details with product names,For each ordered item show the actual product name,"orderdetails, products","orderNumber, productCode, productName, quantityOrdered, priceEach",None,orderdetails JOIN products ON productCode
Get products with product line description,For each product show the full description of its category,"products, productlines","productCode, productName, productLine, textDescription",None,products JOIN productlines ON productLine
Get customers with sales rep names,For each customer show the name of their assigned sales rep,"customers, employees","customerNumber, customerName, salesRepFirstName, salesRepLastName",None,customers LEFT JOIN employees ON salesRepEmployeeNumber
Get orders with customer city,For each order show the customer name and their city,"orders, customers","orderNumber, orderDate, status, customerName, city",None,orders JOIN customers ON customerNumber
Get employees and their manager,For each employee show the name of their manager,employees (self),"employeeNumber, firstName, lastName, managerFirstName, managerLastName",None,employees LEFT JOIN employees ON reportsTo
Get orderdetails with product vendor,For each ordered item show which vendor supplies it,"orderdetails, products","orderNumber, productCode, productVendor, quantityOrdered, priceEach",None,orderdetails JOIN products ON productCode
Get payments with customer country,For each payment show the customer name and their country,"payments, customers","customerNumber, customerName, country, checkNumber, paymentDate, amount",None,payments JOIN customers ON customerNumber
Count customers per country,Count how many customers exist in each country,customers,"country, COUNT(*) AS customerCount",None,GROUP BY country
Total payments per customer,Sum the total amount each customer has paid,"customers, payments","customerNumber, customerName, SUM(amount) AS totalPayments",None,"JOIN payments ON customerNumber, GROUP BY customerNumber"
Number of orders per status,Count how many orders fall under each status,orders,"status, COUNT(*) AS orderCount",None,GROUP BY status
Products per product line,Count how many products belong to each product line,products,"productLine, COUNT(*) AS productCount",None,GROUP BY productLine
Employees per office,Count how many employees work in each office,"offices, employees","officeCode, city, COUNT(*) AS employeeCount",None,"LEFT JOIN employees ON officeCode, GROUP BY officeCode"
Total stock per product vendor,Sum total units in stock for each vendor,products,"productVendor, SUM(quantityInStock) AS totalStock",None,GROUP BY productVendor
Average buy price per product line,Find the average cost price of products in each category,products,"productLine, AVG(buyPrice) AS averageBuyPrice",None,GROUP BY productLine
Orders per customer,Count how many orders each customer has placed,"customers, orders","customerNumber, customerName, COUNT(*) AS orderCount",None,"LEFT JOIN orders ON customerNumber, GROUP BY customerNumber"
Max MSRP per product line,Find the highest retail price in each product category,products,"productLine, MAX(MSRP) AS maxMSRP",None,GROUP BY productLine
Min buy price per vendor,Find the cheapest product each vendor supplies,products,"productVendor, MIN(buyPrice) AS minBuyPrice",None,GROUP BY productVendor
